Easy Way to Remember 🚀

For LeetCode 82:

Find duplicate sequence.
Save duplicate value.
Skip all nodes with that value.
Remove the first node too.
Connect previous unique node to the next unique node.

Important pointers:

temp → current node being checked.
nextNode → searches where duplicates end.
prev → connects the remaining list after deletion.

One-line memory trick:

"If a value repeats, remove the whole group; otherwise move forward."
